  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating locally-led humanitarian response in Ukraine, through governance and capacity strengthening with LNAs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAI, in collaboration with their partner (APH), have co-designed this programme to address specific areas prioritised by Local NGOs that support and strengthen locally-led humanitarian response in Ukraine. Addressing identified priority areas, APH and it&#x2019;s network of 26 Health-focused LNGOs will strengthen their governance, operational and programmatic capacity, improving collaboration, coordination and access to direct funding opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
